# This repository is the private source. It tracks everything: the chapters, the
# figures, the theme, the gates, the archived first edition, and the rendered site
# under docs/.
#
# The public site is published separately by publish.sh, which sends only the
# CONTENTS of docs/ to the public repository. Nothing here needs to be hidden from
# git; the split happens at push time, not at commit time.

